{"id":"101554","t":{"th":null,"ro":"Kidou Senshi Gundam NT","en":"Mobile Suit Gundam Narrative","na":"機動戦士ガンダム NT"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101554-wSg5tvmASqEy.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101554-wSg5tvmASqEy.jpg","color":"#1a93e4","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101554-tOw9HYjjh6NZ.jpg","fmt":"MOVIE","status":"FINISHED","eps":1,"dur":90,"season":"FALL","year":2018,"start":"2018-11-30","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Drama","Mecha","Sci-Fi"],"score":61,"pop":10799,"studio":"Sunrise","desc":"U.C. 0097. The year the Laplace's Box was opened. Despite the revelation of the original charter for the Universal Century, which acknowledges the existence of Newtypes and their rights, the world remains largely unchanged.\n\nAfter the destruction of the Neo Zeon remnant force known as the Sleeves, the event that has come to be known as the \"Laplace Incident\" seems to have drawn to a close. In the final battle, two Full Psycho Frame mobile suits displayed power beyond human imagination. The menace of the White Unicorn and the Black Lion were sealed away from public consciousness, and were consigned to be forgotten by history.\n\nBut now sightings of the RX-0 Unicorn 03, long thought lost two years ago, are being reported. Its name is Phenex, an immortal golden bird.","descTh":"ยูซี 0097 ปีที่กล่องลาปลาซถูกเปิดออก แม้จะมีการเปิดเผยกฎบัตรดั้งเดิมสำหรับ Universal Century ซึ่งยอมรับการมีอยู่ของ Newtypes และสิทธิ์ของพวกเขา แต่โลกก็ยังคงไม่เปลี่ยนแปลงส่วนใหญ่\n\nหลังจากการล่มสลายของกองกำลังที่เหลือของ Neo Zeon ที่รู้จักกันในชื่อ The Sleeves เหตุการณ์ที่เป็นที่รู้จักในนาม \"เหตุการณ์ Laplace\" ดูเหมือนจะใกล้จะจบลงแล้ว ในการต่อสู้ครั้งสุดท้าย โมบิลสูทฟูลไซโคเฟรมสองชุดได้แสดงพลังเหนือจินตนาการของมนุษย์ ภัยคุกคามของยูนิคอร์นขาวและสิงโตดำถูกผนึกไว้จากจิตสำนึกสาธารณะ และถูกส่งไปให้ประวัติศาสตร์ลืมไป\n\nแต่ขณะนี้มีการรายงานการพบเห็น RX-0 Unicorn 03 ซึ่งหายไปนานเมื่อสองปีก่อนแล้ว ชื่อของมันคือฟีเน็กซ์ นกสีทองอมตะ","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":null,"descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"ouRdwOaSi9g","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/101554","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/37764","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"dexclub","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3e_76v-fOxM","lang":"dub","eps":[["1","y:3e_76v-fOxM",1776393493,"x",null,null,{"d":5318,"fin":1}]]}],"covers":["https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101554-wSg5tvmASqEy.jpg","https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101554-wSg5tvmASqEy.jpg","https://img.anime-os.com/media/ogbrgv-large_1_.jpg","https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3e_76v-fOxM/hqdefault.jpg"],"th":null,"act":1776393493,"new":false,"back":true,"rel":[["6336","PREQUEL","Mobile Suit Gundam UC",2010,"OVA","https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx6336-jdAs058XtObM.jpg","https://anilist.co/anime/6336",null,"FINISHED"],["105595","SEQUEL","โมบิลสูทกันดั้ม ฮาธาเวย์ส แฟลช",2021,"MOVIE","https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx105595-40ugr6S9NfOb.jpg","https://anilist.co/anime/105595",null,"FINISHED"],["21658","PREQUEL","MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM UNICORN RE:0096",2016,"TV","https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21658-pOcvE4BrcofO.jpg","https://anilist.co/anime/21658",null,"FINISHED"],["80","SERIES","Mobile Suit Gundam",1979,"TV","https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx80-pdYJ12vSTmad.jpg","https://anilist.co/anime/80",null,"FINISHED"],["1090","SERIES","Mobile Suit Gundam I",1981,"MOVIE","https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx1090-EzpeffMoflBS.jpg","https://anilist.co/anime/1090",null,"FINISHED"],["1091","SERIES","Mobile Suit Gundam II: Soldiers of Sorrow",1981,"MOVIE","https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx1091-VSmUzzebMq7V.jpg","https://anilist.co/anime/1091",null,"FINISHED"],["1092","SERIES","Mobile Suit Gundam III: 